"/><figcaption>2026年11月25日，一名在美國的華裔女子王正儀（Amy Wang）分享一段影片，講述她曾在2019年到訪黃仁勳夫婦舊居的影片。片中可見，屋內有大型水晶吊燈、鋼琴及酒窖，室外設有游泳池，車庫停有一輛法拉利。王正儀亦隔空向黃仁勳妻子洛麗（Lori Huang）表示支持。（IG@thisamylife）</figcaption></figure><p>王正儀的丈夫Eric Young曾在英偉達任職20年。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T10:17:08.281986+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2362,"images":11,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T10:03:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:35:57.808571+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T10:10:45.670077+00:00","content_hash":"ff64c6ba11c62e7c99c6e087a7826cceed394607ee332e8ff3d8b43c62d5c856","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}